  "description": "Interactive Blazor components in .NET WebAssembly without the Blazor JS runtime. Renders Razor components straight to the real DOM through SpawnJS - @onclick, @bind, StateHasChanged, component lifecycle and EventCallbacks all work - and mounts them into any element or shadow root, so Blazor UI can be loaded onto any page (even from a CDN link) with full DOM/CSS isolation.",
